@startuml
title From Keycloak grants to Matrix actions
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFD
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam nodesep 26
skinparam ranksep 32
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #334155
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  FontColor #0F172A
  RoundCorner 12
}

rectangle "**Keycloak**\nRealm roles · matrix-synapse client roles\nsecurity_clearance · 1to1chat.* groups" as Keycloak #E0ECFF
rectangle "**Matrix Authentication Service**\nIssues the Matrix session" as MAS
rectangle "**Policy Sync**\nMatches grants to the room policy\nPublishes a short-lived snapshot" as Sync #E0F2FE
rectangle "**Synapse with policy module**\nEnforces room and 1:1 chat rules\nChecks current room state" as Synapse #DDF4EA
rectangle "**Export Service**\nChecks matrix-access, org-export-admin\nand current room scope" as Export
rectangle "**OrgBot**\nRead-only E2EE room participant\nBuilds a scoped ZIP from available content" as Bot #FFF1D8

Keycloak -down-> MAS : OIDC after matrix-access check
Keycloak -down-> Sync : effective grants
Sync -down-> Synapse : membership, power and snapshot
Synapse -up-> MAS : token introspection
Sync -down-> Export : room map and snapshot
Synapse -down-> Bot : encrypted room sync
Export <-down-> Bot : selected rooms / ZIP
@enduml
